OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen causes disruption in
OL,4,ASouth East
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met Office issued a yellow weather
OL,7,Fwarning for wind for much of England
OL,8,Fbetween 10:00 and 21:00 BST, with gusts
OL,9,Fexpected to reach up to 70mph.
